Summary
=======

Problem:
A link can appear UP while traffic flows in only one direction.

Solution:
UDLD verifies bidirectional communication between neighboring devices.

Benefit:
Detects unidirectional failures and prevents Layer 2 loops.

Limitation:
Does not control excessive broadcast traffic.

